[TITLE]
Every valve type on its own branch off one trunk, a check valve, minor
losses, a power-function pump and a constant-horsepower pump, over a 24 h
pattern with a tank and controls.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand  Pattern
J1    650   0
J2    650   50      P1
;PRV zone
J3    650   120     P1
J3b   648   80      P1
;PSV: a weak feed, then the valve, then a hungry zone
J4    650   10      P1
J5    640   220     P1
;FCV zone, with a low tank behind it
J6    640   100     P1
;TCV zone
J7    645   150     P1
;GPV zone
J8    645   120     P1
;PCV zone
J9    640   160     P1
;PBV zone
J10   650   90      P1

[RESERVOIRS]
R1    700
R2    720

[TANKS]
;ID   Elev  Init  Min  Max  Diam  MinVol
T1    650   12    4    30   40    0
T2    740   10    3    22   45    0

[PIPES]
;ID   N1   N2   Len   Diam  Rough  MLoss  Status
P1    J1   J2   1500  16    110    0.4    CV
P2    J3   J3b  900   8     110    0      Open
P3    J2   J4   3000  5     100    1.0    Open
