V4    J2   J7   8     TCV   6        0
V5    J2   J8   8     GPV   HL1      0
V6    J2   J9   8     PCV   55       1.2    VC1
V7    J2   J10  8     PBV   12       0

[CURVES]
;pump head curve: one point, so EPANET fits a power function
C1    1600  150
;GPV head loss vs flow
HL1   0     0
HL1   100   3
HL1   250   12
HL1   500   40
;PCV percent open vs percent Kv
VC1   0     0
VC1   25    8
VC1   50    30
VC1   75    65
VC1   100   100

[PATTERNS]
P1    0.6  0.6  0.7  0.8  1.0  1.3  1.5  1.4  1.2  1.1  1.0  1.0
P1    1.0  1.1  1.3  1.5  1.6  1.4  1.1  0.9  0.8  0.7  0.6  0.6

[CONTROLS]
LINK PU2 CLOSED IF NODE T2 ABOVE 18
LINK PU2 OPEN IF NODE T2 BELOW 8
LINK P6 OPEN AT TIME 14
LINK P6 CLOSED AT TIME 20

[OPTIONS]
Units      GPM
Headloss   H-W
Trials     80
Accuracy   0.001
Unbalanced Continue 10

